.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-checkout 1  "geectl-checkout 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-checkout \- Check out a package into a git working copy, under the current directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl checkout\fR [\fB\-\-rev\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check out a package into a git working copy, under the current directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-rev\fR \fI<REV>\fR
The revision to check out (a number or a source md5). The latest when omitted
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The OBS project
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The OBS package
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
